# Line endings: LF in the repo and the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf
# says. Build tools (tauri/cargo, npm run bump) rewrite files with LF; with
# autocrlf's CRLF checkouts that showed as modified and failed the release
# preflight's clean-tree check (2026-10-08).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
